cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OCEANLINES, cite the project and the underlying datasets used by the relevant layer."
title: "OCEANLINES: Mapping Earth's Hidden Waterworld"
type: software
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
authors:
  - family-names: Della-Libera
    given-names: Gio
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/giodl73-repo/OCEANLINES"
url: "https://giodl73-repo.github.io/OCEANLINES/atlas/"
abstract: >-
  A visual and quantitative atlas framework for mapping ocean heat reservoirs,
  pathways, anomalies, buried layers, and exchange gates with accessible,
  co-located surface-field inspection, symmetric latitude-ring comparison, and
  full-latitude product-mask continuity diagnostics, without conflating
  temperature, geometry, heat content, transport, or observational uncertainty.
